NE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124600","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124600.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124600.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Fix stale AnimationPlayer menu state\n\n### What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nCloses godotengine/godot#124596\n\nAnimation-specific options in the AnimationPlayer editor popup can become incorrectly disabled for editable animations after closing and reopening the Animation panel, particularly after using Auto Insert Key.\n\nThis PR centralizes the animation menu state updates and refreshes them when the selected animation changes, the current animation changes, the player is cleared, or the Animation dock becomes visible again.\n\nIt also preserves the existing read-only restrictions for animation libraries and handles invalid animation-library references safely.\n\n### Additional information\n\n**Testing**\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- Manual testing has not been performed.\n\n**AI assistance disclosure**\n\nAI tools were used to assist with investigating the issue, reviewing the implementation, and preparing the code changes. The changes have not been manually tested or verified by a successful build.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc